  "topic": "Cancellation and refund policies for adult members of the Tide Workshop community makerspace.",
  "quote": "Cancel at least 24 hours before the session start to receive a full refund of the equipment booking fee. Cancellations less than 24 hours before the session start receive no refund. Exactly 24 hours before the session qualifies for a full refund."
